{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FRIF_SECTION_7_2_2_FlexRay_Interface","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay","page":19,"text":"7.2.2 FlexRay Interface\n[SWS_FrTSyn_00078]\nUpstream requirements: RS_TS_20040, RS_TS_20041\n⌈The FrTSyn module shall call FrIf_GetGlobalTime only if FrIf_GetState re-\nturns FRIF_STATE_ONLINE. This is to ensure that FrIf_GetGlobalTime returns\nvalid time information, i.e. that the FlexRay communication controller is synchronous\nto the FlexRay global time.⌋","caption":"7.2.2 FlexRay Interface","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FRIF_SECTION_7_2_2_FlexRay_Interface","releases":["R24-11"],"page":18,"hash":"d07f2da494a0ef9f","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_FRIF_SECTION_7_2_2_FlexRay_Interface","releases":["R25-11"],"page":19,"hash":"9a01e984b1fdb9f5","caption":""}],"releases":["R24-11","R25-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","rel":["R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_FrIf_05015"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","rel":["R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_FrIf_05170"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_FrTSyn_00078] im Text von SWS_TimeSyncOverFlexRay.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_FrTSyn_00078"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"FrTSyn API dependencies on FrIf","rel":[],"id":"SWS_FrTSyn_00074"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}